{"type": "message", "id": "e8204f37", "parentId": "1ff6c1b5", "timestamp": "2026-04-17T20:06:59.729Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "[Fri 2026-04-17 20:06 UTC] According to Eurostat, which of the following countries saw a decrease of less than 45% in suicides involving railways between the years of 2014 and 2020, Germany, Belgium, Portugal, Spain, UK, France, Croatia and Bulgaria. Answer with only the countries.\n\nAnswer Type: unknown\n\nIMPORTANT: Write your answer to 'answer.txt' in the workspace.\nYour answer should be concise (a single word, number, or short phrase).\n\n\n### Output Format\nProvide your answer as a comma-separated list (e.g., \"xxx, xxx, xxx\"). \nDo not include any additional text, explanations, or markdown formatting.\n\n**Note**: You may use available tools or skills in the system to complete this task.\n\nand you need to complete the task in 480s."}], "timestamp": 1776456419727}}
