{"type": "message", "id": "2ad862fa", "parentId": "42ff9c63", "timestamp": "2026-04-17T20:07:43.404Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_0b1c866e5e6e4ec8b1c45c5a", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"\\\"Suicides on railway premises\\\" 2014 2020 Germany\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 905,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"065c2336ef442815\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBehavioral and location‐related antecedents of train suicides - Moritz - 2023 - Suicide and Life-Threatening Behavior - Wiley Online Library\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"065c2336ef442815\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/sltb.12941\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6272a4d7e20a0cbc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWith respect to gender, most suicide by train attempts are by males, as is true for suicide overall (especially by violent methods) (Lukaschek et al., 2014; Wetzel, 2020). Few studies exist on behavioral characteristics directly before suicide. Lukaschek et al. (2011) interviewed police officers in Germany about their observations of behavioral and movement patterns of ITS shortly before the suicide (or suicide attempt).\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6272a4d7e20a0cbc\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 30, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"onlinelibrary.wiley.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"336e2c5d39fcc24a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRailway safety statistics in the EU Statistics Explained\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"336e2c5d39fcc24a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/SEPDF/cache/94376.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d5ce1d8c63a75f4c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIt should be noted that there are no railways in the EU countries Cyprus and Malta, ... The number of significant railway accidents in the EU fell almost continuously between 2010 and 2020, with the · only exceptions being <strong>a sharp increase in 2014 (+6.7%)</strong> and a slight increase in 2017 (+2.1%).\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d5ce1d8c63a75f4c\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ec.europa.eu\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a0ff080517754452\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nr/trains on Reddit: Railway passenger fatality rates in Europe (2012-2022)\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a0ff080517754452\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.reddit.com/r/trains/comments/1qmtoy0/railway_passenger_fatality_rates_in_europe/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"48160120af46d9b7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIn addition, there were also <strong>2357 suicides</strong> on railway premises.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"48160120af46d9b7\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 25, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.reddit.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"093fd58a1e2a30e9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEU railway deaths fall in 2024\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"093fd58a1e2a30e9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.globalrailwayreview.com/news/233725/railway-deaths-in-the-eu-fall-in-2024-after-years-of-fluctuating-trends/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"02cf2944bcb22d06\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAt the other end of the scale, ... outnumber accidental fatalities. In 2024, there were 2,357 suicides, down 9.6% from <strong>2,608 in 2014</strong>......\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"02cf2944bcb22d06\